<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$5 bln NCDs on Saturday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$5 bln NCDs on Saturday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank will issue T$5 billion in 40-day negotiable certificates of deposits (NCDs) this morning, a central bank official said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Bids will close at 10.20 local time (0220 GMT), the official added.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
